# Keeps the Docker build context small — without this, `docker build` sends
# the whole repo (node_modules, .next build caches, .git history) to the
# daemon, which is multiple GB and can time out mid-transfer (confirmed this
# session: an unfiltered build context reached 8GB+ and failed).
#
# Applies to all three Dockerfiles (root, marketing/, workspace/) — each is
# built with the repo root as context.

**/node_modules
**/node_modules *
**/.next
.git
**/.git
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
docs
STARTER-LIBRARY.md
supabase/.branches
supabase/.temp
